<title>GERMANY: Ifo to release confidence index, hold assembly.</title>
<headline>Ifo to release confidence index, hold assembly.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Ifo research institute will release its May business confidence index 0800 GMT on Thursday, the institute said.</p>
<p>The institute will also hold its general assembly on Thursday.</p>
<p>In April, the west German business confidence index was down 5.5 points while business conditions were down 12.3 points. Business expectations were up 1.7 points</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
